WEBVTT

00:05:59.836 --> 00:06:02.156
So genes do play a role,

00:06:02.156 --> 00:06:04.516
but the environment
also plays a huge role.

00:06:05.716 --> 00:06:08.196
The overabundance of calories
in certain communities

00:06:08.196 --> 00:06:09.676
is a relatively new thing,

00:06:10.396 --> 00:06:12.436
and our genes haven't quite adapted yet.

00:06:13.636 --> 00:06:15.636
In the history of feast and famine,

00:06:16.516 --> 00:06:20.556
genetic selection has prepared us
much better for famine,

00:06:20.596 --> 00:06:22.236
and for good reason.

00:06:22.236 --> 00:06:24.556
Starvation is bad,

00:06:24.596 --> 00:06:27.276
but you could also argue obesity is bad.

00:06:27.276 --> 00:06:29.756
And if obesity is a disease,

00:06:29.796 --> 00:06:34.236
how do we then prevent,
treat or even cure it?